959
00:54:44,777 --> 00:54:48,144
Huwag kalimutang dalhin ang camera, ha?

960
00:54:48,167 --> 00:54:52,767
Plano kong gumawa ng maraming kakanin para dala-dala ko.

961
00:54:52,790 --> 00:54:55,604
Wow, sabik na sabik na ako!

962
00:54:55,627 --> 00:54:59,278
