1125
01:03:48,620 --> 01:03:53,426
Smith, first time mo ba sa Japan?

1126
01:03:53,449 --> 01:03:57,288
Hindi po, hindi ako first time.

1127
01:03:57,312 --> 01:03:59,712
Ganoon ba?

1128
01:03:59,735 --> 01:04:03,624
Nakapunta ka na ba sa Japan dati?

1129
